  "body": "- Elevated Position | Sea Views, Rangitoto & Sky Tower.\r\n- Downstairs bedroom, bathroom & private backyard access.\r\n- Stunning black designer kitchen | premium appliances.\r\n- Luxurious master suite | WIR & ensuite.\r\n- Double internal-access garage | 3 off-street parks.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the grand entrance and elegant lighting set the tone for this impressive family residence. Designed for modern living and multigenerational flexibility, the home offers generous spaces for entertaining, relaxing and accommodating extended family or guests.\r\n\r\n- Separate downstairs lounge\r\n- Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, living & dining.\r\n- Fisher & Paykel integrated fridge/freezer.\r\n- Premium Miele coffee machine, Smeg oven & microwave.\r\n- Well-appointed butler's pantry.\r\n- Feature lighting throughout.\r\n- Cozy lounge with fireplace.\r\n- Seamless flow to a private deck with pergola.\r\n- Third upstairs lounge capturing stunning views.\r\n- Master ensuite featuring a luxurious bath.\r\n- Electric gated entry for added security.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in sought-after Long Bay, this exceptional home is just two minutes from Long Bay Beach and close to the vibrant Long Bay Village, cafes, shops and coastal walkways. Families will appreciate being in zone for Long Bay College and Long Bay Primary School, making this an outstanding opportunity to secure spacious, versatile living in a premium coastal location.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/CAHY",
